<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <decisions>
        <name>Is_Root_Line</name>
        <label>Is Root Line</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Not Root Line</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Root_Line</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.ParentQuoteLineItemId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Which_Discount_Type</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Root Line</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Which_Discount_Type</name>
        <label>Which Discount Type</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Clear_Both_Applied_Discounts</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Discount Removed</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Percent_Discount</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Discount</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Set_Applied_Discount</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Percent Discount</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Amount_Discount</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.DiscountAmount</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Set_Applied_Discount_Amount</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Amount Discount</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Keeps the Quote header&apos;s Applied Discount / Applied Discount Amount in sync with the discount entered on the quote&apos;s single root (commercial) line item. Only reacts to the root line (ParentQuoteLineItemId null) so Service Charge / included-unit bundle children never drive this. Deliberately updates AppliedDiscount / AppliedDiscountAmount only, never Quote.Discount, which has its own DOA approval automation (RES Quote Discount DOA Approval Flow) that must not be triggered as a side effect of this sync. Each branch is a single record-update setting all three fields (AppliedDiscount, AppliedDiscountAmount, AdjustmentDistributionLogic) together in one DML, since Revenue Cloud&apos;s validation checks the final combined field state of an update, not an intermediate one - consolidated 2026-08-27 from two sequential updates per branch (clear-then-set) to cut DML/iteration count in bulk scenarios, per architect direction. Revenue Cloud requires AdjustmentDistributionLogic blank whenever AppliedDiscount is set, and populated whenever AppliedDiscountAmount is set - each branch sets the correct combination in its one update. 2026-08-28: Set_Applied_Discount and Set_Applied_Discount_Amount also clear Quote.RES_Pricing_Stale__c to false, piggybacking on the update that&apos;s already running - this hides the pricing-stale warning banner (shown after a rejected discount is reverted) the moment a genuinely new discount value is entered on the root line, without waiting for a Reprice All. Harmless no-op when the flag was already false. Deliberately NOT added to Clear_Both_Applied_Discounts: RES_Autolaunched_Revert_Quote_Discount_On_Rejection sets the flag true and then nulls this same line item&apos;s Discount/DiscountAmount in the same transaction, which routes through this exact branch - clearing the flag here would immediately undo the flag-set and the banner would never show after a real rejection.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>RES Quote Line Item - After Update - Sync Header Discount {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>RES Quote Line Item - After Update - Sync Header Discount</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Clear_Both_Applied_Discounts</name>
        <label>Clear Both Applied Discounts</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.QuoteId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AdjustmentDistributionLogic</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>varEmptyString</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AppliedDiscount</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>varEmptyNumber</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AppliedDiscountAmount</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>varEmptyNumber</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Quote</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Set_Applied_Discount</name>
        <label>Set Applied Discount</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.QuoteId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AdjustmentDistributionLogic</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>varEmptyString</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AppliedDiscount</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Discount</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AppliedDiscountAmount</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>varEmptyNumber</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>RES_Pricing_Stale__c</field>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Quote</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Set_Applied_Discount_Amount</name>
        <label>Set Applied Discount Amount</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.QuoteId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AdjustmentDistributionLogic</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Equal</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AppliedDiscount</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>varEmptyNumber</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AppliedDiscountAmount</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.DiscountAmount</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>RES_Pricing_Stale__c</field>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Quote</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Is_Root_Line</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterFormula>OR(
    ISCHANGED({!$Record.Discount}),
    ISCHANGED({!$Record.DiscountAmount})
)</filterFormula>
        <object>QuoteLineItem</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <variables>
        <name>varEmptyNumber</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>varEmptyString</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
</Flow>
